 "strings": [
  "",
  "The Earth Federation versus Zeon.",
  "The so-called \"One Year War\"",
  "was ended by the Earth Federation",
  "and the \"Republic of Zeon\"",
  "through the armistice",
  "they concluded.",
  "However...",
  "Many soldiers of the Principality",
  "of Zeon would not accept",
  "this armistice signed by",
  "the Federation and the \"Republic.\"",
  "Many of them rejected the orders",
  "to disarm and cease fighting",
  "from the Republic, those shameful",
  "traitors, and went their own way.",
  "Some left for Axis,",
  "in the asteroid belt",
  "out by the outer planets,",
  "where dark nothingness reigns,",
  "while others went into hiding",
  "all across the Earth Sphere.",
  "Calling themselves Zeon remnants,",
  "they took up the MS and other",
  "forces that remained and",
  "fought on in many places.",
  "In a sense, this could be",
  "called inevitable.",
  "The Zeon War of Independence",
  "was a fight for the self-rule",
  "and independence the space",
  "emigrants yearned for, and even",
  "if it took the form of the Zabis'",
  "tyranny and lust for power,",
  "nevertheless,",
  "to the people of space",
  "it was a light of hope.",
  "Space is a world of death.",
  "The sun's light",
  "does not nurture the living,",
  "but turns to radiation that",
  "ruthlessly takes life; night's dark",
  "does not guard one's rest,",
  "but with the cold of absolute zero",
  "freezes all things.",
  "Even oxygen and water they must",
  "make with their own hands, and",
  "feeding themselves demands",
  "dozens of times Earth's labor.",
  "And the only things protecting",
  "the people of space, standing",
  "between the vacuum and them,",
  "are the colony's eggshell-thin",
  "outer walls and the transparent",
  "aluminum walls that let in sunlight.",
  "Even shielded by those walls,",
  "if a little debris strikes,",
  "if the colony's spin is a little off,",
  "if the air mixture is a little off,",
  "if the air pressure is a little off,",
  "if the radiation rises a little,",
  "if a disease spreads a little,",
  "people die easily.",
  "To live,",
  "to keep everyday life going,",
  "tremendous effort is demanded",
  "of them at every moment.",
  "A world where a single mistake",
  "surely means thousands dead...",
  "That is no world for human life.",
  "And yet,",
  "the people of space, by no choice",
  "of their own, were forced",
  "to live there.",
  "They had been cast away by Earth.",
  "Even so, the people of Earth lived",
  "on resources gathered in space,",
  "ate food harvested in space,",
  "and lived on taxes from space.",
  "The people of space want to feed",
  "their own families",
  "the food they grew themselves.",
  "The people of space want",
  "the taxes they paid spent on",
  "their own children's future.",
  "Is that evil?",
  "To wish to protect one's family...",
  "one's beloved children...",
  "descendants not yet seen...",
  "to wish that they might live",
  "a life even a little more fulfilled.",
  "Is that truly evil?",
  "\"That is evil.\"",
  "In this account, at least, we hold",
  "that some citizens of",
  "the Earth Federation passed",
  "exactly that judgment.",
  "And that being so,",
  "that some would rise, resolved,",
  "for those they loved...",
  "for their children...",
  "for their descendants...",
  "to become evil and fight on,",
  "even if it meant staining",
  "their own hands with blood,",
  "was also only natural.",
  "Those who fought on even while",
  "deeming themselves evil.",
  "Incidents raised by the warriors",
  "of the Zeon remnants, who threw",
  "themselves into a great cause.",
  "The greatest battle among them,",
  "in Universal Century 0083, was",
  "the Delaz Conflict.",
  "Universal Century 0081.",
  "The Earth Federation Assembly,",
  "to make up for the great losses",
  "of people and materiel in the One",
  "Year War, passed the \"Federation",
  "Forces Reconstruction Plan.\"",
  "As one part of that plan,",
  "aimed at raising the technology",
  "for the next generation of",
  "mainstay mass-production units,",
  "the Gundam Development Project",
  "was launched.",
  "Begun with the aim of fusing",
  "and refining the MS technologies",
  "of the Federation Forces and",
  "the Principality of Zeon's forces,",
  "this project, together with",
  "Anaheim Electronics, which had",
  "bought up and absorbed Zeonic",
  "and other Principality companies,",
  "was carried out as a joint effort.",
  "It resembled the practice,",
  "in the Japan of the old century,",
  "of enshrining vengeful spirits",
  "to seal away the harm they cause,",
  "and somehow it hints at a grudge",
  "over its ambivalence toward Zeon",
  "and a fear that would never",
  "fade away.",
  "\"The Gundam Development Project\"",
  "was a great purifying festival",
  "in which the idol called Gundam,",
  "symbol of the Federation, took in",
  "the ghost called Zeon",
  "and absorbed it.",
  "As if to embody",
  "that grudge and that fear,",
  "\"The Gundam Development Project\"",
  "in time came to harbor",
  "a strange distortion.",
  "The greatest of those distortions:",
  "an MS armed with a tactical nuclear",
  "warhead, a weapon of mass",
  "destruction mightier than any MS.",
  "Fear made to erase fear.",
  "It was the second prototype",
  "Gundam, the GP02A Physalis.",
  "Built with many ex-Zeon engineers",
  "and reflecting the design ideas",
  "of the Dom, a famed One Year",
  "War machine, this Gundam, named",
  "for the \"demon lantern\" physalis,",
  "was without doubt a demon, an MS,",
  "born of the Federation's fear",
  "to devour the vengeful spirit",
  "of Zeon.",
  "Distortion invites distortion.",
  "That, too, was surely not chance",
  "but necessity.",
  "Through whatever channels,",
  "word of this demon built to devour",
  "Zeon reached none other than",
  "the Zeon remnants themselves.",
  "And so the curtain rose once more",
  "on a new battle...",
  "Kou Uraki Takes the Stage",
  "Anavel Gato Takes the Stage",
  "Kou Uraki Takes the Stage",
  "Kou Uraki is a man who can be",
  "summed up in a few words.",
  "He was more a boy than a man,",
  "and more a student than a soldier.",
  "After the war ended,",
  "he graduated from officer school",
  "in Nijmegen, the Netherlands,",
  "and at once became a test pilot",
  "at Torrington Base.",
  "In truth, he joined the military",
  "largely in a hobbyist's spirit.",
  "In the One Year War, seen at 15,",
  "he fell for the weapon called MS.",
  "That was his motive.",
  "Pure, in one sense.",
  "Impure, in another.",
  "Yet even that impurity",
  "was not entirely wasted.",
  "He knew his machines, after all.",
  "Torrington, where he was posted,",
  "had many pilots, but not one",
  "understood a unit's traits or flew",
  "an MS better than he did.",
  "One might call him a model case",
  "of \"you excel at what you love.\"",
  "His reputation, according to",
  "a certain friend, was this:",
  "\"Even among Nijmegen's rich boys,",
  " the purest hothouse flower.\"",
  "So the verdict went.",
  "True to those words, he was",
  "single-minded, pure, and innocent.",
  "Because of that innocence,",
  "Kou Uraki, a boy who could not yet",
  "grow into a man,",
  "poured his whole heart into MS.",
  "And the life of this man,",
  "who became a soldier simply",
  "because he loved MS,",
  "would be utterly changed,",
  "set off by his encounter",
  "with a certain thing.",
  "The Gundam.",
  "The newly created",
  "symbol of the Federation.",
  "The white devil that, in the",
  "One Year War, branded terror upon",
  "the Principality of Zeon's forces.",
  "\"The Gundam Development Project\"",
  "Built under this project,",
  "the first prototype Gundam,",
  "GP01 Zephyranthes,",
  "and GP02A Physalis--",
  "these two Gundams",
  "came, for testing under gravity,",
  "to Torrington Base,",
  "where he was stationed.",
  "Being an MS enthusiast, he",
  "naturally went to sneak a look",
  "at the two Gundams.",
  "And then, as if toyed with",
  "by fate,",
  "he ended up witnessing the moment",
  "that Gundam, the GP02A Physalis,",
  "was seized by",
  "the Zeon remnants.",
  "Kou, a pure-hearted man,",
  "could not stand by and allow",
  "what was done before his eyes.",
  "As if by reflex, his body",
  "moved toward the other Gundam,",
  "the GP01 Zephyranthes.",
  "Without a doubt,",
  "this was the moment his life",
  "went awry, one might say.",
  "Had he only not climbed",
  "into the Gundam here, the anguish,",
  "the fierce battles, the hardships,",
  "even the disgrace that came later",
  "would surely have been",
  "no part of his life.",
  "And yet,",
  "he climbed into the Gundam.",
  "He went and did it.",
  "And having boarded the Gundam,",
  "what he came face to face with",
  "was a demon...",
  "Anavel Gato.",
  "The Nightmare of Solomon.",
  "That was the name of the man",
  "who stole the Gundam,",
  "and the name of the demon",
  "Kou Uraki stood against.",
  "Gato",
  "\"I, Anavel Gato,",
  " have waited three years!\"",
  "\"Fools without judgment",
  " like you lot\"",
  "\"will not stand in the way",
  " of our ideals!\"",
  "\"We will seize true liberation",
  " for the space colonists\"",
  "\"from Earth's wicked shackles,",
  " by my sword of justice!\"",
  "Kou",
  "\"In the middle of a tactical",
  " skirmish... what are you saying!\"",
  "From start to finish, the fight",
  "went Gato's way.",
  "Even so, thanks to Ensign",
  "Uraki's efforts, Gato's escape",
  "into space was badly delayed.",
  "Afterward, Ensign Uraki served",
  "the veteran commander of the new",
  "ship Albion, Eiphar Synapse, and,",
  "flying the Gundam GP01,",
  "kept up the pursuit of Gato.",
  "In the end, as far as Africa,",
  "they ran Gato to ground:",
  "Uraki and the Albion crew.",
  "But,",
  "through one man's sacrifice, Gato",
  "made it up into space.",
  "For three years, that man",
  "had led the Zeon remnant army",
  "in Africa: without question,",
  "a hero in his own right.",
  "Noyen Bitter.",
  "Formerly of the East Africa Army,",
  "commander of the 3rd Assault",
  "Mobile Division: this man.",
  "This man, too,",
  "surely lived for a great cause.",
  "The skill with which he held",
  "the Zeon remnants together in",
  "Africa for three long years surely",
  "came from that very cause.",
  "He was truly",
  "a demon defending his nation.",
  "Not Zeon the nation,",
  "but Zeon the spirit.",
  "The space colonists' earnest wish,",
  "their long dream of independence:",
  "a demon guarding that spirit.",
  "His end came",
  "buying time for the launch",
  "of the HLV carrying Gato.",
  "Riding outdated MS,",
  "Bitter and his men pressed in",
  "on the Albion with",
  "a demonic fury.",
  "Though beaten, the sight of them",
  "deeply stirred the hearts",
  "of the Albion crew",
  "and of Kou Uraki.",
  "\"Space colonists...",
  " That's... the enemy.\"",
  "That was something that",
  "Kou Uraki, a man born on Earth,",
  "could not readily understand.",
  "Why did Gato,",
  "Bitter,",
  "and the Zeon remnant soldiers",
  "fight the way they did?",
  "Throwing away life's pleasures,",
  "human happiness, even their lives,",
  "how could they fight so hard?",
  "To one who had been taught that",
  "the One Year War was simply the",
  "Zabi family's ambition unleashed,",
  "it was utterly beyond reach.",
  "Kou Uraki, keeping his doubts",
  "locked in his heart,",
  "went up into space after Gato.",
  "Around him, before he knew it,",
  "comrades had gathered.",
  "A friend from his academy days.",
  "Chuck Keith.",
  "His superior at Torrington Base.",
  "Lieutenant South Burning...",
  "...and his men, the members",
  "of the Immortal 4th Platoon.",
  "And the one who supported him",
  "most of all was the Gundam's",
  "developer, an engineer from",
  "Anaheim Electronics.",
  "Nina Purpleton.",
  "It was her.",
  "Kou, wanting with all his heart",
  "to win her recognition,",
  "pushed himself harder still.",
  "But that drive to improve",
  "at times narrowed his view",
  "and became the reason",
  "he lost his composure.",
  "Nina",
  "\"Unit 1 doesn't have its space",
  " equipment yet, you know.\"",
  "\"I want to get used to it fast.",
  " Besides, even without swapping",
  " parts, this thing can do plenty.\"",
  "\"So impatient...",
  " In space, Unit 1 right now",
  " is worse than a GM.\"",
  "The two, once so close.",
  "But a small misunderstanding",
  "sowed discord",
  "between them.",
  "Albion Mess Hall",
  "\"The Gundam",
  " isn't a toy!\"",
  "\"People who fly it for fun",
  " are a real nuisance.\"",
  "To Kou, who had become a soldier",
  "out of an interest in MS,",
  "might those words not have",
  "cut deep?",
  "At those words, which in a sense",
  "hit the mark,",
  "Kou flew into a rage.",
  "\"I can't believe this.\"",
  "\"Didn't you accept me",
  " as the Gundam's pilot,",
  " Nina?\"",
  "\"If I'd known you were",
  " this pig-headed...\"",
  "\"You're the pig-headed one, Nina!\"",
  "But war, heedless",
  "of human feelings,",
  "strikes without mercy.",
  "Simon",
  "\"Enemy warship approaching!",
  " All hands, battle stations!",
  " I repeat, battle stations!\"",
  "Synapse",
  "\"Aren't the MS out yet!?\"",
  "Navigator",
  "\"Almost!\"",
  "Operator",
  "\"One enemy ship, a Zanzibar!\"",
  "\"Just one ship!?",
  " They'll be tough!\"",
  "An enemy attack right after",
  "reaching space.",
  "It was proof that the Albion's",
  "movements had been detected.",
  "But for the tough veterans who",
  "had survived the One Year War,",
  "a chance encounter amid",
  "scattered Minovsky particles",
  "was an everyday affair.",
  "The Albion crew, unshaken",
  "by the surprise attack,",
  "went on the offensive.",
  "Bate",
  "\"Heh,",
  " old Gelgoogs are a cakewalk.\"",
  "Monsha",
  "\"And it's five on three.\"",
  "Adel",
  "\"Aren't you forgetting one?\"",
  "\"Keith doesn't count.\"",
  "Keith",
  "\"Sorryyy!\"",
  "Meanwhile, Kou Uraki was aboard",
  "ship, chewing on his regret.",
  "By nature, space and the ground",
  "demand vastly different",
  "performance from machines.",
  "Gravity or none, vacuum,",
  "the cycle of pressure and heat...",
  "On the ground and in space,",
  "the machines used differ entirely.",
  "The same goes for MS.",
  "In space, tuning for space",
  "is a must.",
  "The Gundam Kou flew",
  "had not yet finished",
  "its tuning for space...",
  "The Albion's MS team leader,",
  "Lieutenant Burning,",
  "bellowed at the hot-blooded Kou",
  "and tried to hold him back.",
  "\"Damn,",
  " the Gundam could at least hold",
  " the second line!\"",
  "Mechanic",
  "\"Ah, Ensign!\"",
  "\"Kou!\"",
  "\"Don't get in my way!",
  " I'm doing this with the Gundam!\"",
  "Youth's overconfidence and fire.",
  "Or was it,",
  "perhaps, born of anxiety?",
  "Kou lost his composure and,",
  "as if in a fever,",
  "rushed to the Gundam.",
  "Not knowing that a battle full",
  "of despair awaited him...",
  "\"I'll be taking this machine",
  " and its nuclear warhead.\"",
  "\"For the revival of Zeon!\"",
  "The Nightmare of Solomon,",
  "Lieutenant Commander Anavel Gato.",
  "Sent down to Torrington Base,",
  "Australia, for testing in gravity,",
  "the Gundam GP02A was stolen",
  "by this man, whose name is carved",
  "even into modern military history.",
  "Yes, by the Zeon remnants!",
  "What irony.",
  "A demon MS, made to devour Zeon,",
  "had been stolen by a man who bore",
  "Zeon's ideals and its great cause.",
  "Worse, by a hero who, in the One",
  "Year War, carved undying fear",
  "into many Federation soldiers.",
  "Of this man,",
  "little can be said.",
  "After the One Year War, his name",
  "made it into Federation Forces",
  "textbooks, yet he was not a hero",
  "whose story many people knew.",
  "Yet even so, there is something",
  "those few records let us glimpse.",
  "His character is marked",
  "by nobility, lofty ideals,",
  "and an unshakable conviction.",
  "His love for his comrades and",
  "his unwavering will: all who knew",
  "Gato speak of them as one.",
  "But paradoxically, that means",
  "nothing other than that the truth",
  "of the man called Gato",
  "lies hidden beneath",
  "the veil of his nobility.",
  "A noble warrior.",
  "Is that all he was?",
  "This account",
  "would rather say, for now,",
  "that it is not.",
  "He was not a noble warrior,",
  "but a man who tried",
  "to become one.",
  "Not one who embodied his ideals,",
  "but a soul striving to embody them:",
  "that is the man called Gato.",
  "He knew he was imperfect.",
  "And many of those around him,",
  "whether they were aware of it",
  "or not, knew it too.",
  "That is exactly why",
  "they adored him, as he strove",
  "toward that ideal.",
  "He was not one of the brilliant",
  "heroes of so many stories, nor",
  "of the breed later called Newtype.",
  "He knew he was ungifted and raw;",
  "a common man who strove harder.",
  "He must have found that painful",
  "time and time again.",
  "As comrades fell before his eyes,",
  "as his beloved nation crumbled,",
  "whenever he thought how he must",
  "endure Earth Federation tyranny...",
  "and that is why he",
  "stole the Gundam.",
  "Idol of the Earth Federation,",
  "the one believed to have driven his",
  "homeland to ruin: the white devil.",
  "What's more, the newly built one",
  "had been created to seal away",
  "the terror called Zeon:",
  "it was a demon, an MS.",
  "Knowing that, did Gato not seek",
  "to become a demon himself?",
  "Yes, the man called the Nightmare,",
  "as a demon bringing nightmares",
  "upon the Federation, a demon",
  "bent solely on his ideal, resolved",
  "to seize the devil called Gundam.",
  "But one man stood boldly",
  "in the way of Gato's deed.",
  "Into the Gundam GP01, brought",
  "to Torrington like the GP02A,",
  "climbed a man.",
  "A rookie test pilot:",
  "Kou Uraki.",
  "Ensign Uraki's obstruction",
  "badly delayed Gato's",
  "escape into space.",
  "Gato did in the end rise",
  "into space from Africa,",
  "but for that, the leader of",
  "the Zeon remnants in Africa,",
  "Major General Noyen Bitter,",
  "had to be sacrificed.",
  "Formerly of the East Africa Army.",
  "The space colonists' earnest wish.",
  "Without that demon's strength,",
  "Gato could never",
  "have reached space.",
  "Mourning the fallen heroes, Gato",
  "again cursed his own weakness.",
  "But what met Gato in space",
  "was not only the warm welcome",
  "of his comrades.",
  "Aboard the Musai",
  "Captain",
  "\"Commander, we dock shortly.\"",
  "\"His Excellency Delaz must be",
  " waiting eagerly as well.\"",
  "\"How do you find",
  " that Gundam?\"",
  "\"Mm, it's good.",
  " Splendid, for a Federation",
  " machine, let us say.\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Fleet closing fast from the rear!\"",
  "\"Spotter, what were you doing!\"",
  "\"They're friendly!",
  " The Cima Fleet!\"",
  "\"The Cima Fleet!\"",
  "\"...!\"",
  "\"Fleet astern,",
  " do not cut into our course!",
  " We have the right of way.\"",
  "Cima",
  "\"You there, Musai ahead!",
  " Sorry about that...\"",
  "\"Took you for colony wreckage.\"",
  "\"Looks like we",
  " won't stop in time, though.\"",
  "\"Evade!",
  " Evade, now!\"",
  "\"All hands,",
  " brace for impact!\"",
  "\"Ahh-ha-ha-ha",
  " ha-ha-ha-ha!\"",
  "Cima Garahau.",
  "Gato, too, knew that name.",
  "On the eve of the One Year War,",
  "to build up its forces, Zeon formed",
  "countless hastily raised fleets.",
  "Many of them consisted of foreign",
  "legion troops and ruffians",
  "with barely any papers,",
  "and the Cima Fleet, too,",
  "was one such unit.",
  "She and her unit, like its members,",
  "were \"ruffians,\" and their conduct",
  "was loathed even by fellow",
  "Zeon soldiers, it is said.",
  "Just after the One Year War,",
  "when many surviving troops",
  "massed at Karama Point,",
  "they left their comrades unbidden",
  "and went their own way, it is said.",
  "That freewheeling, selfish stance",
  "was something Gato could never",
  "reconcile himself with.",
  "After the war, the Cima Fleet",
  "reportedly turned pirate.",
  "Space colonists turned pirate,",
  "preying on fellow space colonists.",
  "That, too,",
  "was something Gato",
  "could not forgive.",
  "Aboard Delaz's Ship",
  "\"Lieutenant Commander Gato,",
  " reporting back!\"",
  "Delaz",
  "\"Well done.",
  " I've heard the report. Splendid.\"",
  "\"Thank you, sir.",
  " But along the way,",
  " we received a rough welcome.\"",
  "\"Heh heh heh...",
  " Commander Cima Garahau's",
  " fleet, I take it.\"",
  "\"You know already, do you?\"",
  "\"Do remember me from now on.\"",
  "\"Spotted you on patrol, you see.\"",
  "\"Let's just say it was",
