  "\"...Yes, Commander.\"",
  "\"......\"",
  "\"Sir?\"",
  "\"Mm, understood.\"",
  "\"A Federation fleet.\"",
  "\"If we hold our present course,",
  " our whereabouts",
  " may well be exposed.\"",
  "\"Three ships...!",
  " Excellency, leave this to me!\"",
  "\"No, I'll go.",
  " I haven't brought a gift yet.\"",
  "\"Very well.",
  " Show us what",
  " the Cima Fleet can do.\"",
  "\"Your Excellency!\"",
  "\"Yes, at once!\"",
  "\"Commander,",
