  "\"Operation Stardust's success",
  " needed the Gundam you seized\"",
  "\"and our fleet at full strength;",
  " both were indispensable...\"",
  "\"I will guide Cima!\"",
  "\"...Gato,",
  " look at things more broadly...\"",
  "\"Excellency...",
  " My heart... has been cleansed.",
  " I will stay by your side until I die.\"",
